Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:25:55 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 20/31] Baikal: psX Baikal southbridge drivers (bpcie, ICC)
 from the Linux psX 7.2 Baikal target that has run on a Baikal B1; MSI
 compose/write exports they need; AHCI completion poll
 (libahci.ps4_ahci_poll_ms, off by default); Baikal AHCI DMA boundary and SATA
 PHY order as in that kernel

